Verification re-checks existing inline findings against the new head: no new findings, no `withWritablePrCheckout`, and `buildVerificationWorkspaceTools` installs `readWorkspaceFile`, `searchWorkspace`, and `getWorkspaceDiff` only. Each thread owns one reply carrying `VERIFICATION_STUB_MARKER`, found via `src/agentWork/verificationThreadLedger.ts` and edited in place by `src/agent/verification/publishVerification.ts`. `fixed` and `already-resolved` add no comment; a prior stub is rewritten, then the thread resolves. `dismissed` rewrites the stub with evidence plus the `loadRepoPolicy` suggestion, then resolves. `verificationHeadFreshness` in `src/agentWork/verificationPublishGate.ts` gates on `getHeadSha()`; a stale head returns `STALE_VERIFICATION_RESULT` (`completed` with `stale_head`), never a clean success or a publish. Failure is one `VERIFICATION_FAILURE_START` block with `VERIFICATION_FAILURE_TEXT`, no diagnostics. Guard: `test/publishVerification.test.ts`.
